// Strap-on boosters, as assemblies: placing one copies its parts into a craft,
// held by its `attach` node (on its axis, near its top), which lets go. Each
// hangs from a node of the core pointing down, rolled so that its −X faces the
// core. Written by tools; the craft that use them are these placed round a core.
